{
  "info": {
    "name": "Inference Router — assessment demo (tier 1)",
    "description": "The curl-driven case set from docs/RUNBOOK.md (the case definitions live in docs/REPORT.md §8), as an importable collection.\n\nTwo variables to set before running (collection ⚙ → Variables):\n  baseUrl — the gateway origin (default: the live deployment)\n  apiKey  — the key from admin@demo.local (Console → API Keys; reveal and copy it on the key card)\n\nStreaming routes answer with SSE: the first `event: meta` carries backend,\nfallbackTriggered and the full routingPlan; `event: final` carries metering +\nquota. Confirm each decision visually afterwards in the console (Playground\nX-ray live, Observability → routing decisions for the record).\n\nOperator scenes (fallback via ROUTING_CHAIN/MOCK failure modes, upstream\noutage) are NOT in this collection — they need an env change\n+ restart; see docs/RUNBOOK.md (tier 2).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://router.kreasiodigital.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "sk_set_your_issued_key"
    },
    {
      "key": "stressKey",
      "value": "sk_stress_key_0000000000000000"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "A — routing picks",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "A1 chat · simple → tier A",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chat",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"what is your refund window?\"}"
            },
            "description": "Expect meta.routingPlan[0].reason = \"chat: simple question\", backend openrouter-tier-a."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A2 chat · complex → tier B",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chat",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"Explain why a gateway uses fallback, compare two failure modes, and list the detailed steps an operator follows when the policy also fails.\"}"
            },
            "description": "Expect reason \"chat: complex question\", backend openrouter-tier-b."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A3 assistant · strong + simple → tier A (conf ≈ 0.80)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"how do I cancel my order?\"}"
            },
            "description": "Expect meta.retrieval.confidence ≈ 0.80 (strong), plan [tierA, tierB]."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A4 assistant · weak band → tier B (conf ≈ 0.50)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"can I sell items on the marketplace?\"}"
            },
            "description": "Confidence in [0.48, 0.55): answered, labelled weak, capable tier takes it."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A5 backendPin · pinned tier B first",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"how do I cancel my order?\",\"backendPin\":\"openrouter-tier-b\"}"
            },
            "description": "Expect plan[0] = pinned by request (eval A/B), tier A as fallback behind it."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "A6 backendPin · unknown id → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"how do I cancel my order?\",\"backendPin\":\"ghost\"}"
            },
            "description": "Expect HTTP 400 invalid_input with details.allowed listing the backend ids."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "B — refuse / quota / auth / validation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "B1 refusal · conf < 0.48, no model call",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"is the moon made of cheese?\"}"
            },
            "description": "Expect meta refusal:true backend \"none\", final refused with reasoning; cost 0; consumes a request slot only."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "B2 refusal · complex shape + low conf",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"explain why dragons hoard gold, using multiple reasoning steps\"}"
            },
            "description": "Complex shape (explain/why/multiple/steps) AND low confidence (≈0.17) → refused before routing; tier B never reached."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "B5 quota · requests 1..3 of the 3/day fixture tenant",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{stressKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"how do I track my package?\"}"
            },
            "description": "Fire these and the next request repeatedly until the 429 — the stress fixture tenant allows 3 requests/day (UTC-daily counters); at a fresh UTC day: 3 × 200, then 429."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "B5 quota · repeat → 429",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{stressKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"how do I track my package?\"}"
            },
            "description": "Duplicate/run until denied: expect 429 quota_exceeded with {limit, used, reset:\"UTC midnight\"}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "B6 auth · unknown key → 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer sk_not_a_real_key_at_all"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"hi\"}"
            },
            "description": "Expect HTTP 401 unauthorized. Variant: remove the Authorization header entirely — same shape."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "B6 auth · no header → 401",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"hi\"}"
            },
            "description": "Missing header — fail-closed with the identical machine-readable body."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "B7 validation · message > 4000 chars → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"\"}"
            },
            "description": "Schema-driven rejection before routing/quota/model."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "B7 validation · unknown field → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{apiKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/support-assistant",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"message\":\"hi\",\"unexpectedField\":true}"
            },
            "description": "additionalProperties: false — strict schema."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}